# Summary

According to the charter, each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter. [[cite:obs-7d117e16ace2ca11b882b8f1c669001eace7f63e "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

The annex specifies the ordinary contribution amount: Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January. [[cite:obs-5f2fc949f5732efef83819236a9be8d4bab43667 "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]]